<h3 id="top-bar">Top Bar</h3>
<p>
	On the left side you can put Site Tagline <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd> → <kbd><samp>Customize</samp></kbd> → <kbd><samp>Site Title &amp; Tagline</samp></kbd></kbd>, very usefull for all kinds of slogans.
</p>
<p>
	The right side is top menu area so you can make a new menu in the <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd> → <kbd><samp>Menus</samp></kbd></kbd>. You must choose <b>Top Bar Menu</b> theme location and that's it.
</p>